    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For the first time, sport climbing was "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "included",
            "zh": "列入"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Summer Olympics",
            "zh": "夏季奥运会"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Tokyo",
            "zh": "东京"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Japan. There were three "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "events",
            "ref": "v-event"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Let’s see what they were!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Speed"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Two climbers move up a 15-metre wall. The winner is the one who climbs to the top in the shortest time. It’s like running "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "vertically",
            "zh": "垂直地"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! But don’t worry. They have "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "safety ropes",
            "zh": "安全绳"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". So, they won’t fall off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Bouldering"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Climbers move across many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "routes",
            "ref": "v-route"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on a 4-metre wall. They have four minutes to do this. The winner is the one who climbs the most routes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Lead"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Climbers try to see how high they can climb on a wall. The wall is over 15-metre high. They have six minutes to climb."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Each climber "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "competes",
            "zh": "比赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in all three events. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ranking",
            "ref": "v-ranking"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in each event is "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "multiplied",
            "zh": "使相乘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The climbers with the lowest "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "scores",
            "zh": "分数"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " win."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "速度攀岩（Speed）：运动员上方系绳保护，按指定路线进行速度竞技，以在最短时间内完成规定高度为胜者。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "抱石（Bouldering）：在抱石赛中，攀登者在无绳索状态下，不依赖任何外在辅助力量完成攀岩。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "难度攀岩（Lead）：运动员下方系绳保护，带绳向上攀登，按照比赛规定有次序地挂上中间保护挂索进行比赛。比赛结果以在规定时间内选手到达的岩壁高度来判定。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
